@base = http://localhost:4000
@origin = http://localhost:4000

### Sign in first (REST Client keeps the session cookie)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "email": "reader@example.com", "password": "correct-horse-battery" }

### Hybrid search with reranking (debug output shows each stage's timing)
@workspaceId = replace-with-a-workspace-id
POST {{base}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/search
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "query": "how does the model compute attention", "topK": 8 }

### Keyword only, PDFs only
POST {{base}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/search
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "query": "how a network is trained with gradient descent", "mode": "keyword", "sourceTypes": ["PDF"] }

### Split the question into sub-queries first
POST {{base}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/search
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "query": "how does nanoGPT sample text and what do temperature and top-k change", "queryMode": "decompose" }
